# Local-only overrides for `wrangler dev`. Copy to `.dev.vars` (gitignored).
#
# The per-user Icemail API key is NOT stored here — each user passes their own
# key on every request via the `Authorization: Bearer <key>` header. This file
# only overrides non-secret config for local development.

# Point the tools at a local/staging Icemail API while developing.
# ICEMAIL_API_BASE="http://localhost:8080"
